  the E004 signer (app.signer decorator seam) → mint + store a LIC1 token. Fail-closed: archived plan 409,
  signer-unavailable 503 with NO license created. Verified offline against the product key via the Rust core.
- US2 Revoke (terminal, idempotent). US3 Suspend/Reinstate (active↔suspended, 409 invalid transition).
  US4 Transfer to another customer (bounded by LICENSE_TRANSFER_LIMIT, default 3; 409 at the limit).
