  customer registry (dup ref 409); GDPR erasure (anonymize-if-licensed else hard-delete, FR-019); signed-key
  retrieval; RBAC (viewer reads, admin mutates) with audited 403 security events; tenant isolation (forced RLS).
- Frontend: Licensing console views (Issue / Licenses / Customers) behind RBAC, wired to licensingApi.
- Cross-cutting: migration 0007 (customer + license, composite FKs, forced RLS + grants); audit of all 7
  actions with no PII / no signing key; single-issuance perf < 1s; licensing CI workflow.

